            "review_title": "Review at The Vagabond Pâtisserie & Café",
            "review_text": "Chau Tran\n1 contribution\n0\nBad customer service\nJun 2022 • Solo\nI’ve never been to this place nor eating any cake here, but I’ve been ordering cakes for special occasions. Last October, I ordered 2 cakes and 1kg of beef ball, they forgot my beef ball and I have to complain with the customer service rep. Last month, I ordered a cake for my mom’s birthday, this time both of my mom and dad was disappointed at the cake as it wasn’t good. Like they said, the cake was tasteless and didn’t stand well. I talked to the customer service rep via facebook messenger, they blame on my parents didn’t know how to preserve the cake WTH? This was clearly an insult!!! Moreover, since I live in America, I have to make payment via paypal. They charged me extra for “transferring fee”. The cake was 670,000 VND including shipping fee, and they charged 761,000 VND. For the price I paid, this is totally not worth it. Save yourself and your money, stay away from this place as they don’t give a f*ck about their customers!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 12, 2022",
